%description:
Tests the black-hole detection of a running path MTU search (mtuProbing = 2),
as Linux tcp_mtu_probing() (RFC 4821 section 7.7). The scenario is that of
tcp_mtu_probe_13, but the search runs from the start, between the base MSS
(1024, MTU 1076) and 1500, and the server, a passive opener, keeps its MSS of
1460. At the fourth timeout, the retransmissions last longer than R1, and the
lower bound of the search falls to the smaller of the base MSS and half of its
MSS: 512, MTU 564. The MSS falls to it before the retransmission (B016), and
later a probe of MTU 1032 gets through. RFC 4821 first sets the MTU to the lower
bound and halves only at the next timeout; Linux halves at once.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 8s
*.srv_app.sendScript="1.0 40000"
*.*_tcp.typename = "LinuxTcp"
*.srv_tcp.mss = 1460
*.cli_tcp.mss = 1460
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.mtuProbing = 2
*.tcptester.pathMtu = 1100
*.srv_tcp.pathMtu = 1500

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[2.439 B015] A.1000 < B.2000: A 501:1949(1448) ack 1 win 16   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(2438,4)# dropping, larger than the path MTU
[4.071 B016] A.1000 < B.2000: A 501:1013(512) ack 1 win 16   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(4070,4)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: a black hole after 3.07s of retransmissions, the lower bound of the path MTU search falls to 564
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: snd_mss is 524, the search runs from 564 to 1500
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Performing retransmission #4; increasing RTO from 1.632s  to 3.264s, and cancelling RTT measurement
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1032 is acknowledged, snd_mss is 992, the search runs from 1032 to 1500
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
